      "text": "A mother is giving her newly married daughter a few tips on running a home.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "zhena",
      "text": "For example, on the towels in the bathroom I always have a B for brow and an H for hindquarters.",
